      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个书架上的书是第二个书架上的书的两倍。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：设第一个书架上放了 $x$ 本书，第二个书架上是 $y$ 本。",
        "如果从第一个书架拿出 $8$ 本放到第二个书架上，那么第一个",
        "书架上是 $(x-8)$ 本，第二个书架上是 $(y+8)$ 本。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第二个书架上的书是第一个书架上的书的一倍半，所",
        "以有",
        "$1.5(x-8)=y+8$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果从第二个书架拿出 $2$ 本放到第一个书架上，那么第",
        "一个书架上是 $(x+2)$ 本，第二个书架上是 $(y-2)$ 本。",
        "根据已知条件有",
        "$x+2=2(y-2)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x$ 和 $y$ 的值应满足方程组：",
        "$\\begin{cases}1.5x-y=20,\\\\↵x-2y=-6.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程组，得：$x=23$，$y=14.5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据题意，$x$ 和 $y$ 的值应当是自然数，所以这个题无解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "476",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两数的和是 $13$，差是 $2$。求这两个数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "477",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "矩形的周长是 $30$ 米，长比宽多一米，求矩形的边长。"
      ]
    },
